    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Pin To Win&quot; is a pins-building light Rogue game that uses balls to trigger pins to produce different effects and build different powerful combinations. Please configure your pins and set off to fight!<br><br>Game features<br><br>- The focus is on pins, not balls<br>Players can change the pins on the machine, and each pin can produce a different style effect. However, enemies can also interfere with the nails on the platform.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/3122bde7801b24be46bdf701ec5f43ca.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/3122bde7801b24be46bdf701ec5f43ca.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/3122bde7801b24be46bdf701ec5f43ca.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Light gameplay, fun is the most important thing<br>What could make a roguelike player happier than working hard to form an overwhelming combination? Enjoy the thrill of chaining pin effects and knock down powerful enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/026617f6e22e053ec583dfe52d15a443.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/026617f6e22e053ec583dfe52d15a443.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/026617f6e22e053ec583dfe52d15a443.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Multiple class and different machines<br>There are 7 classes in the game (the number will continue to increase, and there will be at least 15 professions in the future). Different classes use different machines, making the game full of freshness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/6afb8267445931a02c5d2140e2c1efc1.avif?t=1739704869\" width=600 height=278 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Pin To Win&quot; is a pins-building light Rogue game that uses balls to trigger pins to produce different effects and build different powerful combinations. Please configure your pins and set off to fight!<br><br>Game features<br><br>- The focus is on pins, not balls<br>Players can change the pins on the machine, and each pin can produce a different style effect. However, enemies can also interfere with the nails on the platform.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/3122bde7801b24be46bdf701ec5f43ca.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/3122bde7801b24be46bdf701ec5f43ca.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/3122bde7801b24be46bdf701ec5f43ca.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Light gameplay, fun is the most important thing<br>What could make a roguelike player happier than working hard to form an overwhelming combination? Enjoy the thrill of chaining pin effects and knock down powerful enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/026617f6e22e053ec583dfe52d15a443.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/026617f6e22e053ec583dfe52d15a443.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/026617f6e22e053ec583dfe52d15a443.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Multiple class and different machines<br>There are 7 classes in the game (the number will continue to increase, and there will be at least 15 professions in the future). Different classes use different machines, making the game full of freshness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/6afb8267445931a02c5d2140e2c1efc1.avif?t=1739704869\" width=600 height=278 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1739704869\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796190/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1739704869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
